{"type":"message","id":"aabe6425","parentId":"6456613e","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:25:33.303Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 18:25 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: ParMETIS 算法优化技术调研\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\n正在优化 cgnsMeshCutter 项目的 ParMETIS 剖分算法，目标是提升计算效率和降低内存占用。\n\n## 已知问题（需重点研究）\n\n### P0 - distribute() 负载不均衡\n- 当前问题：数据分布不均匀，导致部分进程空闲\n- 需要研究：\n  1. ParMETIS 的负载均衡策略\n  2. 图划分后的数据分布最佳实践\n  3. 动态负载调整技术\n\n### P0 - Interface 全量广播 O(SIZE²)\n- 当前问题：Interface 信息以 O(SIZE²) 复杂度广播\n- 需要研究：\n  1. MPI 高效通信模式（点对点、集合通信）\n  2. 稀疏数据通信优化\n  3. Interface 信息压缩/序列化技术\n\n### P1 - Interface 字符串匹配效率低\n- 当前问题：字符串匹配性能瓶颈\n- 需要研究：\n  1. 高效字符串匹配算法（哈希、Trie、KMP等）\n  2. 网格数据结构中 Interface 表示方式\n  3. 避免字符串操作的替代方案\n\n## 调研要求\n\n1. **搜索策略**\n   - 使用 web_search 搜索 ParMETIS 官方文档和论文\n   - 搜索 MPI 通信优化最佳实践\n   - 搜索网格剖分并行化技术\n\n2. **分析代码**\n   - 阅读 `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter` 中的相关代码\n   - 定位 distribute() 函数实现\n   - 定位 Interface 处理相关代码\n   - 分析当前实现的具体问题\n\n3. **输出要求**\n   - 针对每个问题提供具体优化方案\n   - 评估优化方案的技术可行性\n   - 提供实现建议和参考资料\n\n## Deliverable\n一份技术调研报告，包含：\n1. 三个已知问题的根本原因分析\n2. 每个问题的 2-3 个优化方案\n3. 推荐方案的优先级排序\n4. 相关技术文档和参考链接\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/search-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772619933301}}
{"type":"message","id":"4e7c1b6b","parentId":"aabe6425","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:25:45.692Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me understand the task:\n\n1. **Workspace**: `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter` - confirmed project directory\n2. **Task**: ParMETIS algorithm optimization research for cgnsMeshCutter project\n3. **Three P0/P1 issues to research**:\n   - P0: distribute() load imbalance\n   - P0: Interface O(SIZE²) broadcast\n   - P1: Interface string matching inefficiency\n\nMy workflow:\n1. ✅ Confirm workspace - `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter` is clear\n2. Understand research question - need to research ParMETIS optimization techniques\n3. Check clarity - scope is clear, I need to:\n   - Search for ParMETIS documentation and papers\n   - Search for MPI communication optimization best practices\n   - Analyze code in the project directory\n   - Provide optimization solutions\n\nLet me start by:\n1. Exploring the project structure to understand the codebase\n2. Finding the distribute() function\n3. Finding Interface handling code\n4. Then doing web searches for optimization techniques\n\nLet me begin.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我将开始 ParMETIS 算法优化技术调研。首先确认工作区，然后分析代码并搜索相关技术资料。\n\n## 工作区确认\n- **项目目录**: `/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter` ✅\n\n让我开始分析项目代码结构，定位关键问题点。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-76e29357fb3f48caaeea6b37691a1888","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter -type f \\( -name \"*.cpp\" -o -name \"*.h\" -o -name \"*.hpp\" -o -name \"*.c\" \\) | head -50"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-72c09ff7f785446b9678b1e77d93dfa4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":6724,"output":609,"cacheRead":6141,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13474,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"