{"type":"message","id":"257c73cf","parentId":"14e61ac1","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:31:31.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a good comprehensive research report. Let me also update the memory file as per the AGENTS.md instructions.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-d93c640e9a754b429216ac63fd6ab4e9","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Search Agent Memory - 2026-03-04\n\n## Research Sessions\n\n### Session 1: ParMETIS 算法优化技术调研\n**Time:** 2026-03-04 18:25\n**Task:** cgnsMeshCutter 项目 ParMETIS 剖分算法优化调研\n**Status:** ✅ Complete\n\n**Key Findings:**\n1. **distribute() 负载不均衡** - 根本原因是简单块分布策略与分区结果不匹配\n2. **Interface 广播优化** - 代码已部分优化，剩余问题可通过 MPI 邻居集合通信解决\n3. **字符串匹配** - 面匹配已使用整数哈希，瓶颈在序列化/反序列化\n\n**Recommended Actions:**\n- 优先实现二进制序列化（最高收益）\n- 采用 MPI 邻居集合通信减少通信复杂度\n- 考虑多约束分区改善负载均衡\n\n**Report:** `$HOME/.openclaw-reports/search-agent/2026-03-04-parmetis-optimization.md`\n\n---","file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/search-agent/workspace/memory/2026-03-04.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":48302,"output":316,"cacheRead":8575,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57193,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772620271852}}
